{"ref":"BDB, אֲבִידָע","hw":"אֲבִידָע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִידָע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my father took knowledge</em><strong>)</strong> a son of Midian <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">Gn 25:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">1 Ch 1:33</a>. Cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אבידע</span>, Hal<sup>MA 192, 202</sup>, also <span dir=\"rtl\">ידעאב</span>, DHM<sup>ZMG ’83, 399</sup>.","next":"BDB, אֲבִיָּ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, אֲבִידָן"}